bone staff quest~
You'll find, in the slaughter, a foe who is regarded as the engine of death.  
Time does not bother him.  He has prepared and embraced death.  Find him and
return his head and most valuable possession.  Far off into the horizon a black
tower looms, Just before entry into this eerie place a hidden shadow dancer
holds the key.  You will require this key to open a container in which a very
special rune of decay is located.  Find this item and bring it to me no matter
what the cost.  A stealer of souls walks the corridors in the fourth floor of a
tower.  I want to look into his eyes as I devour his soul.  Finally, bring me
the head of the Waymera creature and the staff he wields.
~
Find and slay the engine of death and bring me his embrace.  Track down Waymera
and bring me his staff.  Bring me the Soul Stealer's severed head and soul.  
Find and return to me a rune of decay.
~
